cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these simulation inputs, please cite the associated paper in
  preferred-citation and record the repository commit used.
title: >-
  Simulation inputs for Choosing Spatial Resolution in the Residence-Time
  Approach to Local Diffusivity
type: dataset
url: https://github.com/mvondomaros-lab/interval-paper-data
repository-code: https://github.com/mvondomaros-lab/interval-paper-data
abstract: >-
  Molecular dynamics structures, topologies, force-field parameters, periodic-cell
  information, and selected NAMD/Colvars configurations for water in POPC lipid
  bilayers and water, acetone, and 6-MHO in a model stratum corneum lipid barrier.
  These inputs accompany a study of interval-width selection in the residence-time
  approach to position-dependent diffusivity. Production trajectories, restart
  checkpoints, and analysis scripts are not included.
